ode5.irmos:
Rising early we cry to Thee, O Lord;
save us, for Thou art our God,//
and we know none other besides Thee.

ode7.irmos2:
The godless order of the lawless tyrant fanned the roaring flame;
but Christ bedewed the God-fearing children with the Spirit,//
therefore He is greatly blessed and supremely exalted.
